# This repo: `wawona.io` (public docs site)

Document the product map accurately. Prefer `/docs/swinging-bridge/`,
`/docs/desktop/`, `/docs/vms-containers/`, `/docs/mode-a-b/`, Wasm/Runtime pages.

## Voice

- Swinging Bridge ≠ Desktop/LockScreen ≠ VMs/containers ≠ Wasm packages.
- Mode A/B: say which. Store/TestFlight/Play copy must **never** pitch jailbreak,
  TrollStore, or JIT as the way to use Wawona.
- Website **may** describe Mode B and `repo.wawona.io/jailbreak/` on dedicated
  pages; keep Mode A product pages clean.
- Formerly **anowaW** → always **Wawona Swinging Bridge** (alias `/docs/anowaw/` OK).
- Wawona Runtime package manager is **App Store compliant** (Wasm only; no Mode B Runtime).

Deploy note: Pages ship from **`master`**. Merge docs there when public
URLs must update. `development` is the work branch.

See always-applied `wawona-product-map`.
